{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03123","headline":"和崔尚书喜雨 · 张九龄","name":"和崔尚书喜雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积阳虽有晦，经月未爲灾。\n上念人天重，先祈云汉回。\n仁心及草木，号令起风雷。\n照烂阴霞止，交纷瑞雨来。\n三辰破黍稷，四达屏氛埃。\n池溜因添满，林芳爲洒开。\n听中声滴沥，望处影徘徊。\n惠泽成丰岁，昌言发上才。\n无论验石鼓，不是御云台。\n直颂皇恩浃，崇朝遍九垓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}